Native macOS dependency compiler diagnostics in the 0.49.0 RC4 build:
remove one unused contact-curve binding, name GC_MakeSegment2d directly
instead of its deprecated compatibility alias, and copy the returned
B-spline knot array before reparametrising it. The mutable copy and the
segment implementation stay the same; no warning-suppression flags or
geometric tolerance changes are introduced.

